    "chunk_text": "gyt willa\u00f0 myngian georne freonda gehwilcne, ealswa us neod is gelome to donne, \u00fe\u00e6t gehwa & \u00fe\u00e6t he oft & gelome h\u00e6bbe on gemynde, \u00fe\u00e6t mannum is m\u00e6st \u00feearf oftost to gemunene, \u00fe\u00e6t is & \u00fe\u00e6t hy rihtne Christendom rihtlice healdan & \u00fe\u00e6t hy godcundan lareawan geornlice hyran & & \u00fe\u00e6t hy Godes cyrican \u00e6ghwar georne gri\u00f0ian & fri\u00feian & mid leohte & lacum hi gelome gegretan, & \u00fe\u00e6t hy Godes gerihta \u00e6ghwylce geare mid rihte gel\u00e6stan & freolsa & f\u00e6stena rihtlice healdan. & \u00fe\u00e6t hy Sunnandaga cypinga & folciscra gemota georne geswican. & \u00fe\u00e6t hy Godes \u00feeowas symle werian & weor\u00f0ian. & \u00fe\u00e6t hy Godes \u00feearfan frefrian & fedan. & \u00fe\u00e6t hy wydewan & steopcild to oft ne ahw\u00e6nan, ac georne hy gladian. & \u00fe\u00e6t hy \u00e6l\u00feeodige men & feorran cumene ne tyrian ne ne tynan. & \u00fe\u00e6t hy o\u00ferum mannum unriht ne beodan ealles to swy\u00fee; ac manna gehwylc o\u00ferum beode \u00fe\u00e6t riht, & se \u00fee ahwar heonan for\u00f0 rihte laga wyrde, Godes o\u00fe\u00feon manna, gebete hit georne, swa hw\u00e6\u00feer swa & gif for godbotan feohbot arise\u00f0, swa swa wise woroldwitan to steore gesettan, \u00fe\u00e6t gebyre\u00f0 rihtlice, & a swa man bi\u00f0 mihtigra her am for worulde o\u00fe\u00feon \u00feurh ge\u00feing\u00f0a hearra on hade, swa sceal he & \u00fey man sceal",
